        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Barkeep's Advice"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, fortune, linguistic, mental)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe barkeep gives some pertinent advice to a single creature other than themself. For 24 hours, when that creature fails a skill check or saving throw, they can recall this advice and reroll the check, using the second result instead. Once that creature uses this ability, its effect ends. A creature that receives the Barkeep's Advice is temporarily immune to the ability for 1 month."
            },
